*''Malva alcea'' subsp. ''alcea'' – southern Sweden to southern and eastern Europe and northern Turkey 
*''Malva alcea'' subsp. ''ribifolia'' {{small|(Viv.) Kerguélen}} (synonym ''Malva ribifolia'' {{Small|Viv.}}) – Corsica

